WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.778 --> 00:00:06.488
11 times is a lot of rereading but that's a what good friends do with a letter the

2
00:00:06.488 --> 00:00:12.267
entrance was the test and had to pass to get into Queens a school in Charlotte Town

3
00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:15.122
where students trained to become teachers

4
00:00:15.122 --> 00:00:20.398
Students from all over Prince Edward Island took it so Anne wasn't the only one

5
00:00:20.398 --> 00:00:22.268
competing with her own class

6
00:00:22.268 --> 00:00:28.631
Notice how the author handles time in this chapter weeks of waiting go by in just a

7
00:00:28.631 --> 00:00:29.321
few pages

8
00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:34.644
Authors do that when nothing much happens so they can save the slow detailed riding

9
00:00:34.644 --> 00:00:38.557
for the moments that matter remember we stretched our stories

10
00:00:38.557 --> 00:00:44.222
Watch for the spot where the writer slows way down and gives you every little detail

11
00:00:44.222 --> 00:00:47.325
that's the author telling you to pay attention

